Code from other projects
------------------------
Code taken from another project is listed here with its source repository,
revision, files, author and license, and keeps its own notice in the file.

CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft, revision 2ac500925b6b),
Copyright (c) the ArtCraft Team and CADCraft contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0.
The egui viewport's design and algorithms: the view transform and zoom about
the pointer, the adaptive grid and its line-count guard, segment clipping
and the way the canvas paints shapes with egui. They are re-written here
for BlackCAD's display list and live in:
  crates/cad-view/src/view.rs, grid.rs, draw.rs (std-only logic)
  apps/viewport/src/main.rs, paint.rs (the egui and eframe layer)
Only CADCraft's canvas and application shell were read. Its DWG and DXF code
(crates/dwg, the acadrust crate) was not read; see docs/PROVENANCE.md.

Third-party crates in apps/viewport
-----------------------------------
egui and eframe (https://github.com/emilk/egui) and rfd, the file dialogs
(https://github.com/PolyMeilex/rfd), MIT OR Apache-2.0 or MIT, and the
crates they depend on, as resolved in apps/viewport/Cargo.lock. They are
linked into the desktop viewport only; nothing else in the repository
depends on them.
